+Wed Feb 28 00:35:52 CET 2007  ero@dkbza.org
+  * Increased version number
+
+Wed Feb 28 00:35:04 CET 2007  ero@dkbza.org
+  * Fixed bug with large NumberOfRvaAndSizes values that could not be converted to int
