+N: Michele Petrazzo
+C: Italy
+E: michele.petrazzo@gmail.com
+D: Creation of the demo/unix_daemon.py code.
+
+N: Wentao Han
+D: Bug report #104 (socket.accept() might return None instead of a valid address
+   and EPIPE might be thrown by asyncore on OS X).
+
+N: Ben Timby
